{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Detach enums and map keys between exporters**\n\nThe copy still shares enum instances and every map key. Enums may expose mutable state or a mutable `@JsonValue`, while keys are reachable through `toWireMap()`; mutation by one exporter can therefore alter later exporters' records. Convert enums to detached JSON scalars and copy keys using the mapper's key-serialization semantics. Add mutable-enum and mutable-key isolation tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7pooI9","finding_digest":"8e6c376214265f1d40c1c7b6864d97136c58335d2d618a641524f1e001a94dd8","finding_id":"arf_v1_rzwdoyquezpr2qgby63imtmxcn","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsightrecord.java::operations::exporter-mutation-isolation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsightrecord.java::operations::exporter-mutation-isolation","line":69,"observation_digest":"c1671cd43b59645cfd2896038bca51b23f4ce89420e9f8ea5f52f13c0a96aa08","observation_id":"aro_v1_yftrzvb3lfsfz7jisybyxssrwi","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/Json.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_rzwdoyquezpr2qgby63imtmxcn","published_at":"2026-09-02T23:48:38Z","review_id":"arr_v1_brd3pfs5righqijat55m42wkqi","reviewed_base_sha":"54b01c910cb06c69336afcb2c5f3f220fbe7b0b0","reviewed_head_sha":"3b6eb771df61db642c999e1d308344c97b3cf686","reviewer":"codex","start_line":63,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_qwuveqwmh43hfumxf4irsu5hrd","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-02T23:48:38Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
